# The Linear A cache (data/cache/, data/images/, data/manifest.json) is committed so
# the web app works without a crawl; it is CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 and must keep the SigLA
# and lineara.eu credit. The Linear B corpus (DAMOS, Univ. of Oslo) is research-only
# and stays local; its manifest carries checksums so a rebuild is reproducible.
